{"type":"message","id":"95540259","parentId":"33ef8cb4","timestamp":"2026-03-19T01:56:17.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我找到了群里发送的一些文件，但这些只是部分文件。从消息记录来看，朱雅静主要发送的是文件夹（folder），而不是直接的文件。文件夹里面应该有每月的报表数据。\n\n但是我注意到群里直接发送的文件有限，主要是一些模板文件。实际的月度报表数据都在文件夹里。\n\n由于我无法直接访问云空间文件夹，我需要请用户把需要的Excel文件直接发送到群里。让我告诉用户这个情况，或者尝试下载已有的文件看看是否能获取能耗数据。\n\n让我先下载这些文件看看内容。但这些文件是2023年和2025年7月的，可能不是最新的。\n\n让我再仔细看看群消息，确认2025年1月-2026年2月的报表是以什么形式发送的。从之前的消息可以看出，这些报表都是以文件夹形式发送的，文件夹里有每月的报表。\n\n我需要告诉用户，我无法直接读取文件夹里的内容，需要他们把Excel文件直接发送到群里。或者我可以尝试开启云空间权限。\n\n让我先尝试用文档解析工具来读取这些已有的文件，看看是否有能耗数据。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"群里直接发送的文件比较少，主要是文件夹形式的报表。让我先下载已有的Excel文件，看看是否包含能耗数据：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_y8rr1b7lflan_1","name":"feishu_im_user_fetch_resource","arguments":{"file_key":"file_v3_00nq_9b830f04-e18f-4057-a810-1a3b88234e4g","message_id":"om_x100b497bf5a616040ec1c8c31a81e65","type":"file"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":2505,"output":328,"cacheRead":49917,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52750,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773885367058}}
{"type":"message","id":"0063ee10","parentId":"95540259","timestamp":"2026-03-19T01:56:18.208Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_y8rr1b7lflan_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_fetch_resource","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b497bf5a616040ec1c8c31a81e65\",\n  \"file_key\": \"file_v3_00nq_9b830f04-e18f-4057-a810-1a3b88234e4g\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"size_bytes\": 19691,\n  \"content_type\": \"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\",\n  \"saved_path\": \"/tmp/openclaw/im-resource-1773885378197-a4f08490-f395-42f2-b589-f5811a235fd6.xlsx\"\n}"}],"details":{"message_id":"om_x100b497bf5a616040ec1c8c31a81e65","file_key":"file_v3_00nq_9b830f04-e18f-4057-a810-1a3b88234e4g","type":"file","size_bytes":19691,"content_type":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","saved_path":"/tmp/openclaw/im-resource-1773885378197-a4f08490-f395-42f2-b589-f5811a235fd6.xlsx"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773885378202}}
{"type":"message","id":"a4144ae6","parentId":"0063ee10","timestamp":"2026-03-19T01:56:21.294Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我成功下载了Excel文件。现在我需要解析这个文件来提取能耗数据。让我使用miaoda-doc-parse技能来解析这个Excel文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5s59kel2cu1o_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/skills/miaoda-doc-parse/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":175,"output":77,"cacheRead":52733,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52985,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773885378208}}
{"type":"message","id":"d313ec7e","parentId":"a4144ae6","timestamp":"2026-03-19T01:56:21.312Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5s59kel2cu1o_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: miaoda-doc-parse\ndescription: \"Use when user needs to parse, extract, or read content from documents (PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, etc.) Converts documents to Markdown via IDP (Intelligent Document Parsing). 触发词：文档解析, 解析文档, 解析 PDF, 解析 Word, 解析 Excel, 读取文档, 提取文档内容, doc parse, IDP, 智能文档解析, parse document, 文档转 Markdown, 读取 PDF, 读取 PPT, 提取表格, 文档识别\"\n---\n\n# Document Parse\n\n通过 `miaoda-studio-cli doc-parse` 将文档解析为 Markdown 格式（基于 IDP 智能文档解析）。\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| 参数 | 说明 | 必需 | 默认值 |\n|------|------|------|--------|\n| `--file` | 文档路径或 URL | 是 | - |\n| `--output, -o` | 输出格式: text/json | 否 | text |\n\n## 支持的文档格式\n\n| 格式 | 扩展名 | 典型场景 |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| PDF | `.pdf` | 报告、论文、合同 |\n| Word | `.doc`, `.docx` | 文档、方案 |\n| PowerPoint | `.pptx` | 演示文稿 |\n| Excel | `.xlsx` | 表格数据 |\n| CSV | `.csv` | 结构化数据 |\n| 纯文本 | `.txt`, `.md` | 文本文件 |\n| 网页 | `.html` | HTML 页面 |\n\n## 使用示例\n\n```bash\n# 解析本地 PDF 文件\nmiaoda-studio-cli doc-parse --file report.pdf\n\n# 解析远程文档并输出 JSON\nmiaoda-studio-cli doc-parse --file https://example.com/document.docx --output json\n\n# 解析 Excel 表格\nmiaoda-studio-cli doc-parse --file data.xlsx --output json\n```\n\n## 使用场景决策\n\n```\n需要获取文档内容\n├─ 文档是本地文件或可下载 URL → miaoda-studio-cli doc-parse\n├─ 文档是网页（需要抓取）→ miaoda-studio-cli web-crawl（见 miaoda-web-fetch skill）\n└─ 文档是飞书云文档 → 使用 feishu skill\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| 错误 | 正确做法 |\n|------|----------|\n| 用 `miaoda-studio-cli doc-parse` 解析网页 URL | 网页内容用 `miaoda-studio-cli web-crawl`（见 miaoda-web-fetch skill） |\n| 不检查文件格式是否支持 | 确认文件扩展名在支持列表中 |\n| 需要结构化数据但未加 `--output json` | 需要程序处理时加 `--output json` |\n| 文件路径包含空格未加引号 | 路径有空格时用引号包裹：`--file \"my file.pdf\"` |\n| 解析飞书云文档用 doc-parse | 飞书云文档使用 `feishu` skill 通过 API 读取 |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773885381304}}
{"type":"message","id":"c56657a6","parentId":"d313ec7e","timestamp":"2026-03-19T01:56:25.503Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我现在可以使用miaoda-studio-cli doc-parse来解析Excel文件。让我执行命令来解析这个文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9yjyyqcxhdaq_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"miaoda-studio-cli doc-parse --file /tmp/openclaw/im-resource-1773885378197-a4f08490-f395-42f2-b589-f5811a235fd6.xlsx --output json","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":903,"output":105,"cacheRead":52733,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53741,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773885381311}}
