{"type":"message","id":"ba32933e","parentId":"7823cb49","timestamp":"2026-03-19T03:45:50.148Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the \"TJ-能耗日报\" group. It's a chat where people submit daily energy consumption reports. Looking at the messages, each day someone submits:\n- 水 (water)\n- 地热水 (geothermal water)\n- 电 (electricity)\n- 气 (gas)\n- 余额 (balance)\n- 总费用 (total cost)\n\nThis is the daily energy consumption report group! But it seems like this is more of a daily reporting chat, not a structured database.\n\nLooking at the format:\n- 3月18日: 水79地热水136电6120气39余额（20996.75）总费用6366.36\n\nLet me get more messages to see the historical data, and also look for any structured data like Excel files or tables.\n\nActually, the user wants to analyze the energy consumption data. Let me get more historical messages to compile the data. Let me get more pages of messages to collect the daily reports.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！这是\"**TJ-能耗日报**\"群，每天有人提交能耗数据。让我获取更多历史消息来提取完整的能耗记录：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_v3zk59nnri5i_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_f0e70a9cec35c171bd3b697d221e8acc","page_size":50,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMLYeh_EeJux2IyWMlj2dxCcFSy25OmPtHo8mLKZ2t_ETZrpHbomIzgUo364G87PnM8047oM3M0RbdKxHxIddPu-PTbzs463Y_9Zk9dT03sdB"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":3807,"output":378,"cacheRead":41981,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46166,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773891929266}}
